<!doctype html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#07090d"><title>Silver · تسجيل الدخول</title><meta name="description" content="نيبولا منصة تخزين سحابي شخصية وآمنة لحفظ ملفاتك ومشاركتها بروابط خاصة."><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Nebula Cloud Storage"><meta property="og:title" content="تسجيل الدخول · Nebula"><meta property="og:description" content="نيبولا منصة تخزين سحابي شخصية وآمنة لحفظ ملفاتك ومشاركتها بروابط خاصة."><meta property="og:url" content="<%= siteUrl %>/login"><meta property="og:image" content="<%= siteUrl %>/og-image.png"><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans+Arabic:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/login.css"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="any"><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32.png"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png"><link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/responsive.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/premium.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/site.css?v=1"><meta name="csrf-token" content="<%= csrfToken %>"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/vendor/ibm-plex-sans-arabic/400.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/vendor/ibm-plex-sans-arabic/700.css"><script src="/security.js?v=1"></script></head>
<body class="silver-login"><div class="silver-noise"></div><div class="silver-glow glow-one"></div><div class="silver-glow glow-two"></div>
<header class="silver-nav"><a href="/" class="silver-brand"><span class="silver-logo">S</span><span>SILVER<small>PRIVATE CLOUD</small></span></a><a href="/register" class="create-link">إنشاء حساب <span>↗</span></a></header>
<main class="silver-main"><section class="silver-story"><div class="silver-kicker"><span class="silver-live"></span> SYSTEM ONLINE <span class="kicker-line"></span> SECURE ACCESS</div><div class="silver-symbol-wrap"><div class="silver-ring ring-a"></div><div class="silver-ring ring-b"></div><div class="silver-symbol">S<span>.</span></div><div class="orbit-dot dot-one"></div><div class="orbit-dot dot-two"></div><div class="orbit-dot dot-three"></div></div><p class="silver-overline">BUILD. LEARN. BREAK. REBUILD.</p><h1>لا تكتفِ بالمشاهدة.<br><span>اصنع شيئاً حقيقياً.</span></h1><p class="silver-description">مساحتك الرقمية الخاصة، حيث تتحول الأفكار إلى واقع وتبقى ملفاتك تحت سيطرتك.</p><div class="silver-tools"><span>PYTHON</span><i></i><span>AI</span><i></i><span>OPENCODE</span><i></i><span>SVPC</span></div><div class="silver-mantra"><span class="mantra-mark">“</span><div><b>CREATE, NOT JUST CONSUME.</b><small>Study → Understand → Experiment → Improve</small></div></div></section>
<section class="silver-login-side"><div class="login-panel"><div class="panel-top"><span class="panel-index">01 / ACCESS</span><span class="panel-secure">◈ مشفّر وآمن</span></div><div class="panel-heading"><div class="small-cube">S</div><p class="silver-overline">WELCOME BACK</p><h2>مرحباً بعودتك</h2><p>سجّل الدخول للعودة إلى مساحتك.</p></div>
<% if (notice) { %><div class="silver-alert <%= notice.type %>"><%= notice.text %></div><% } %>
<form method="post" action="/login" class="silver-form"><label for="email">البريد الإلكتروني <span>EMAIL ADDRESS</span></label><div class="silver-input"><span>✉</span><input id="email" type="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required autocomplete="username"></div><label for="password">كلمة المرور <span>PASSWORD</span></label><div class="silver-input"><span>⌑</span><input id="password" type="password" name="password" placeholder="أدخل كلمة المرور" required autocomplete="current-password"><button type="button" class="show-password" aria-label="إظهار كلمة المرور">◉</button></div><label class="remember-row" for="remember"><input id="remember" type="checkbox" name="remember" value="1" checked><span class="remember-box"></span><span>تذكرني<small>البقاء مسجلاً للدخول على هذا الجهاز حتى لو غبت مدة طويلة</small></span></label><button class="silver-submit" type="submit"><span>دخول آمن</span><span class="submit-arrow">↗</span></button></form><% if (googleEnabled) { %><a class="silver-submit" href="/auth/google" style="display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:10px;text-decoration:none;margin-top:12px;background:#fff;color:#111"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="#EA4335" d="M24 9.5c3.54 0 6.71 1.22 9.21 3.6l6.85-6.85C35.9 2.38 30.47 0 24 0 14.62 0 6.51 5.38 2.56 13.22l7.98 6.19C12.43 13.72 17.74 9.5 24 9.5z"/><path fill="#4285F4" d="M46.98 24.55c0-1.57-.15-3.09-.38-4.55H24v9.02h12.94c-.58 2.96-2.26 5.48-4.78 7.18l7.73 6c4.51-4.18 7.09-10.36 7.09-17.65z"/><path fill="#FBBC05" d="M10.53 28.59c-.48-1.45-.76-2.99-.76-4.59s.27-3.14.76-4.59l-7.98-6.19C.92 16.46 0 20.12 0 24c0 3.88.92 7.54 2.56 10.78l7.97-6.19z"/><path fill="#34A853" d="M24 48c6.48 0 11.93-2.13 15.89-5.81l-7.73-6c-2.15 1.45-4.92 2.3-8.16 2.3-6.26 0-11.57-4.22-13.47-9.91l-7.98 6.19C6.51 42.62 14.62 48 24 48z"/></svg><span>الدخول بحساب Google</span></a><% } %><div class="silver-or"><span></span><small>YOUR SPACE. YOUR RULES.</small><span></span></div><p class="silver-signup" style="margin-top:10px"><a href="/forgot-password">نسيت كلمة المرور؟</a></p><p class="silver-signup">مستخدم جديد؟ <a href="/register">أنشئ حسابك الآن</a></p><div class="panel-foot"><span><i></i> CONNECTION PROTECTED</span><span>SV / 001</span></div></div><p class="side-caption">كل بداية عظيمة تبدأ بخطوة واحدة.</p></section></main>
<footer class="silver-footer"><span>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> SILVER CLOUD</span><span>BUILD · LEARN · REBUILD</span><a href="/">الصفحة الرئيسية ↑</a></footer><script src="/login.js"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/mercury.css?v=1"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/neon.css?v=1"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/nebula-pro.css?v=2"></body></html>